@startuml N2
!pragma layout smetana
title N2 Adapter: Managed Resource Holder (newly introduced by Change2)

interface AutoCloseable <<Target (JDK)>> {
  +close()
}
interface "ExtensionContext.Store.CloseableResource" as CloseableResource <<Target (deprecated)>> {
  +close()
}
class "ManagedResourceExtension.Holder" as Holder <<Adapter, new in CH02>> #C8F7C5 {
  -resource : Object
  -factory : ResourceFactory<Object>
  +close()
}
interface "ResourceFactory<T>" as ResourceFactory <<Adaptee, new in CH02>> #C8F7C5 {
  +destroy(T)
}
class AbstractExtensionContext <<Client>> {
  -createCloseAction() : CloseAction
}

Holder ..|> AutoCloseable
Holder ..|> CloseableResource
Holder --> ResourceFactory : close() calls factory.destroy(resource)
AbstractExtensionContext ..> AutoCloseable : close() when the store closes
AbstractExtensionContext ..> CloseableResource : close() if auto-close of AutoCloseable is disabled
' aligned-with-record
legend right
  <b>Counted participants</b> (record in the dataset)
  Target: AutoCloseable
  Target: CloseableResource
  Adapter: Holder
  Adaptee: ResourceFactory#destroy
  Client: AbstractExtensionContext#createCloseAction
  Grey classes: real, shown for context, not counted
endlegend
@enduml
